{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act22side_level_act22side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act22side",
  "stageId": "act22side_08",
  "title": "她的影子",
  "storyCode": "FC-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1150fe4436925a955a5fe436032701f8bb86fae9b9cea6d48c4a945504b3c1bf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "我就知道，他們不會來這堆被天災砸爛的石頭裡面找人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "多虧早上起了那麼大的霧，不然我們還沒這麼容易脫身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "啊，小心。我們畢竟沒有防護裝備，在這裡受傷的話，是有感染風險的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "莫蘭，你也是。源石多發環境，對感染者來說更加危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "好，我會注意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......凱莉睡著了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "是，應該只是睡了，不是昏迷，我能感覺到她的呼吸還很平穩。睡著能讓她少受一些痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "......但我還是怕，再不停下來處理凱莉的傷勢的話，她撐不過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......你們，失望嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "不會的。你不是說過了嗎？我們現在不得不和一些深池士兵戰鬥，是因為他們不想要第二位“領袖”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "但他們還有更大的目標，不會一直追捕我們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "現在這樣逃亡的生活，我們也已經習慣了，可以忍耐下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "不過在那之後呢？你還沒有告訴過我們你的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我還沒有把握，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "對了，廢墟深處，也許有源石晶簇少一些的地方，我想去看看，能不能找到一個暫時的藏身處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "大家都應該停下來休息一下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "可那個方向，是不是有人在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "雖然看上去只是普通人，可我們應該也要躲開。就像你之前說的一樣，這種地方有人出沒，太異常了，一定要小心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "......你看起來很害怕。怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "沒關係，不用擔心我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "（......她來過這裡？在這附近？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "哎，那邊的人，走路的樣子是不是有些奇怪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "別看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "咿——她怎麼已經——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "她應該，離世有一段時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "只是，那種源石技藝操控著這具身體在行動，就像我們之前見到的那些深池士兵一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "為什麼要操縱一個普通人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我還不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "——跟我走吧，這些被源石技藝控制的死者，我來應對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "這裡光線很暗，沿著石階往下走的時候，小心裸露的碎晶簇......莫蘭，你背著凱莉方便行動嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "我沒問題。只要你的火一直燃著，我看得見東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "好。我們儘量往深處走，別發出太大聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......蓋爾王的王城？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "對於那業已覆滅的王朝，有人想像它灰石的骸骨間堆滿死戰不退的將士盔甲，有人聲稱它仍將黃金的王冠藏匿於古老陰森的機關之下。\n有人以現代倫蒂尼姆的高牆去襯托王城的恢弘，以無邊的克拉斯德內海比擬英雄時代美德的興榮，又哀歎它被維多利亞的陰影日漸銷蝕。\n人們想像這座古城是塔拉悲情的墓碑，怨恨的亡魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但它只是安靜地坐在山丘上，袒露出此地未有王城時的核心。\n生出野草，爬滿藤蔓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "這得是多久以前的東西了？五百年？一千年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "噓......不要把凱莉吵醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "抱歉......我只是有點驚訝，不對，太驚訝了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "說真的，雖然我們年年演的戲目都會講不同的蓋爾王故事，我也知道我們是塔拉王國子民的後代，所以被叫做塔拉人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "......但以前沒有人相信，這一切竟然真的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "甚至還有傳說裡，熔融了所有塔拉戰士的武器、顛覆了王朝命運的熔爐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "......很久以前，我遇到過一個四處尋找吟遊詩人的城裡人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "他對我說過，傳說雖然有許多是後人編造，但那些故事裡，一定留下了歷史的痕跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "葦草，你一定知道很多，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "你不喜歡這裡嗎？我們進來後，你就一直不說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......或許是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "很小的時候，我就經常讀著塔拉的傳奇故事，直到入睡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "為維多利亞王室寫作的人也好，想要留存塔拉文明的人也好，他們總是寫，“德拉克的天性是爭鬥”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "傳說最初率領蓋爾氏族的德拉克，燒乾河水向南而行，逃離互相廝殺爭奪王座的族親，開拓了塔拉的土地。\n傳說維多利亞的紅龍殺死了塔拉最後一位遊牧的德拉克首領，給他牙牙學語的幼子安上蓋爾王的頭銜。\n傳說塔拉的德拉克自此囚於宮廷，哪怕“放逐王”拋下王冠行走荒野二十年，歸來覲見時仍被在位的至親殺害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "塔拉的歷史，充滿了這樣的故事。德拉克的王城裡，遍佈陰謀與鮮血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "比起憧憬和幻想，我......害怕這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......不過，天災留下的晶簇，這裡幾乎看不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "在這裡休息，應該是安全的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "那就好。來，莫蘭，我幫你把凱莉放下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "讓她躺在這邊吧，背風的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "這裡的牆很堅實，位置也很隱蔽，我們即使在晚上生起火，應該也不會被外面的人注意到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "哎，葦草她怎麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "讓她自己去那邊看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "葦草聽見輕微的響動。\n她收回了想要觸摸眼前生鏽設備的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "它是......活著的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "它只不過是，誰都可以驅動的東西......有人把它重新點燃了，你為什麼要覺得奇怪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......嗯，她來過了，不奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "透過孔隙，她看到了紫色的火焰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "這裡是曾經的王城，她一定會來......也一定會發出嘲笑聲吧？傳說中的君王，留下的東西，就只是這些而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "這裡燃起了她的火焰，所以附近才會有那麼多不得安息的死者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "那只是，在附近迷路渴死的流浪者，無緣無故地被死亡的火焰喚起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不......別靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你也害怕那簇火吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我看得到，你想熄滅它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......嗯，它會給許多人帶去痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可你真要這麼做的話，我不會讓你過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她點燃了深池的火。你知道，你沒辦法再燃起同樣的火焰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她做了很多壞事，說了很多漂亮的謊言，可是，那些是非做不可的。她號召了成千上萬的塔拉人跟隨，不挑剔聖人或暴徒，貴族或賤民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這些，你做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "不......我做得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我不信，那些犧牲都是必要的，也絕不會相信，塔拉人要得救，只有她的那一種方法可行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是從很早以前，從橡林郡的那場大火開始，她就已經是領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她想起那個趴在街道上傷痕累累的女孩。自己想拉起她，讓她快走，卻又害怕自己向她伸手的話，她也會變成一堆灰燼。\n姐姐走到了她身邊。\n你想活下去嗎？姐姐問道。\n你旁邊就是下水道。從那裡爬下去，那些可惡的貴族就再也追不上你。\n蔓德拉。她從那裡逃出來，最終又回到那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而你，你終究沒有伸手拉起任何人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "嗯，如果我能夠向她伸出手，也許，事情會變得不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "如果她真的得救，那她本該知道，除了像那天的縱火者那樣，擁有為非作歹的權力......她還有許多路可以走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可實際上，你連自己的力量都害怕，只能讓別人來操縱它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......所以，連姐姐都對你失望了，更不用說其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......不，你這麼說，不對。你說的都是已經過去的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "現在的我，已經握住過他人的手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我不能說，是我拉起了他們，但他們想要前行的話，我的火，可以燒出道路。哪怕那條路，是他們牽著我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "她......如果她能看到這一切，她不會失望的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你只是，偶然有了同伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在他們面前，你表現得能戰鬥、演說、號召大家......你假裝自己有力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可你其實只是在模仿她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你只能，成為她的影子。任何手段，她都可以用到極致，而你比她，多出來太多猶豫和軟弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她想起那些縱火燒毀塔拉人街區的軍官。他們放聲嘲笑塔拉人的自以為是，嘲笑幾乎不識字的塔拉人竟然抗議橡林郡的法令不公。\n她知道，這就是姐姐最後對老師說的，將會發生的事情。\n維多利亞人親手點燃了仇恨的火焰。在燒光一切之前，這場大火不會停下。\n別眨眼，姐姐對她說，看清我們的生活是如何一次又一次地被毀去。\n在遍地焦黑屍骸中間，掌控死亡之火的德拉克抬手施術。\n冰涼的紫火蓋過了原本灼燒著死者的烈焰。\n其實那死亡的火焰幾乎從來沒有取走過任何生命。她只是准許他們從灰燼中爬起，在死後得以向燒毀他們家園的人復仇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......我不後悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "過去，我一直覺得她是對的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "“為了最終建成塔拉人理想的國度，我們的生命都可以作為燃料，投入火中......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "在她身邊，我一直是這麼說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......可燃料燒盡之後，她的國度裡，還剩下誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我猶豫過，反思過，逃避過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我不後悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我逃到了這裡，見過了她看不到的人與事。我想說的，一定與她不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "所以，我也不會再害怕想起她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我絕不會......困在自己的影子裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "認出這座王城時，你不是正在害怕嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想，你無法回答你的“同伴”你們將去哪裡，但心裡早已備好答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不變成我的話，你在深池的夢想裡，要如何找到自己的位置呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——拉芙希妮，你想要什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "葦草想起那場大火裡走向她們的死者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "text": "......快停下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他們傷痕累累，面目全非，眼中卻仍然燃燒著渴望。\n他們完成了對維多利亞軍官的復仇，走向為他們燃起火焰的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "text": "不要再向前走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "text": "你們應該......得到安息！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——反應過來的時候，離她最近的人已經倒在她的面前，空洞的眼眶注視著她。\n在她自己一閃而過的熾烈火光之中，死亡的火焰熄滅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "text": "......對不起，姐姐。對不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "text": "我，不是有意破壞你的法術......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "text": "——做得好，拉芙希妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她在恐懼中抬頭。\n姐姐第一次對她露出了讚許的微笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "text": "做得真好。你的火光，如此耀眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "text": "我始終在想，你要怎樣才肯顯露出自己的力量，令他人矚目？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "text": "再向我展示一次你的才能吧，讓我看到，你竟然真有可能將我的火焰逼退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "text": "你會戰勝我嗎，我親愛的妹妹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
